Audit complete: **FAIL / NOT_LEGIT**.

The proof reconstructs and is non-vacuous, but:

- The submitted program violates the unrestricted string contract, e.g. `"A"` becomes `"y"` instead of remaining `"A"`.
- The generated semantics proves false Python behavior, including `""[0] => ""` and incorrect Unicode execution.

Detailed seven-stage report: [REVIEW.md](/audit-output/REVIEW.md)  
Reproducible scripts and bounded logs: [evidence](/audit-output/evidence)
